                </div>
            <h1 class="article-title content " >
                PromOat Oat beta-glucan
            </h1>
        </div>
</section>

    <section id="main">
        <div class="container">
                    <div class="main-top ">
                        <div class="content ">




                        </div>
                    </div>
                <div class="main-aftercontent">
                    
<div><div>

<!-- Content / -->
<div id="5640741" class="content content-centered">
    <div class="content-body">
        

<h2 class="content-title" style="font-size: 2rem; color: #575756; line-height: 1.2; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 10px;">&nbsp;The natural, healthy, functional oat ingredient</h2>
<p style="text-align: left;">PromOat Oat beta-glucan is a high-concentration, soluble oat bran fibre, containing very little insoluble fibres. It is extracted from Swedish wholegrain oats without the use of chemicals. PromOat is a natural source of beta-glucan, the dietary fibre in oat bran that provides important health and functional benefits. In the body, oat beta-glucan helps to maintain healthy cholesterol levels, blood glucose levels and digestion. As a&nbsp;functional ingredient, it thickens and stabilizes emulsions and imparts an indulgent, creamy mouthfeel. PromOat is available in both conventional and gluten-free versions.</p>
<h4 style="text-align: center;"><a href="/contact/contact-food-ingredients/">Contact us for more information</a></h4>
    </div>
</div>
<!-- / Content -->
</div><div>
<!-- List / -->
<div id="5640742" class="list list--pingpong  ">





    <div id="list-data" class="list-wrapper list-onecolumn js-ajax-list-replace" data-cols="sm:1,md:1,lg:1,xl:1,xxl:1">



<div class="list-inner-wrapper--static-area"><div><!-- Callout / -->


<div id="5640743" class="callout callout-standard">
        <div class="callout-wrap">

                <picture class="callout-picture">
                    <!--[if IE 9]><video style="display: none;"><![endif]-->
                    <source srcset="/siteassets/5.-food-ingredients/ingredienser/havrefiber/3.-promoat/teaser-intro-promoat2.jpg?maxwidth=370" media="(min-width: 768px)">
                    <!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]-->
                    <img srcset="/siteassets/5.-food-ingredients/ingredienser/havrefiber/3.-promoat/teaser-intro-promoat2.jpg?maxwidth=500" class="callout-image">
                </picture>

            <div class="callout-body">
                <h3 class="callout-title">Benefits of PromOat</h3>
                <div class="callout-text"> 

<p>PromOat Oat beta-glucan can give manufacturers and consumers access to healthy foods and beverages. Its beta-glucan content is up to 34%, which makes it easy to achieve the daily dosages required for specific health benefit claims. PromOat is also available as gluten-free. Its beta-glucan content is up to 29%.</p>
<p>PromOat Oat beta-glucan is a clean-label fibre, produced from Nordic oats. It is soluble, clean-tasting, and neutral in colour. It can be used in food and beverage formulations for its health and functional benefits. PromOat can also thicken and stabilize emulsions and impart an indulgent creamy mouthfeel.</p></div>
            </div>

        </div>
</div>
<!-- / Callout -->
</div><div>

<!-- Content / -->
<div id="5640744" class="content content-centered">
    <div class="content-body">
        

<p>PromOat is part of the range of oat ingredients produced by Lantm&auml;nnen, which also includes PrOatein Oat protein and Avenacare Oat beta-glucan for cosmetics applications.</p>
    </div>
</div>
<!-- / Content -->
</div></div>    </div>


        <div class="list-link">
            <a href="/contact/contact-food-ingredients/">Contact us</a>
        </div>

</div>


<!-- / List --></div><div>

<div id="5640749" class="banner banner--fixed-height banner banner--factbox ">
        <picture class="banner-image">
            <!--[if IE 9]><video style="display: none;"><![endif]-->
                <source srcset="/siteassets/5.-food-ingredients/ingredienser/havrefiber/3.-promoat/banner-promoat-health-benefits.jpg?maxwidth=1920" media="(min-width: 1600px)">
                <source srcset="/siteassets/5.-food-ingredients/ingredienser/havrefiber/3.-promoat/banner-promoat-health-benefits.jpg?maxwidth=1600" media="(min-width: 1366px)">
                <source srcset="/siteassets/5.-food-ingredients/ingredienser/havrefiber/3.-promoat/banner-promoat-health-benefits.jpg?maxwidth=1366" media="(min-width: 768px)">
            <!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]-->
            <img srcset="/siteassets/5.-food-ingredients/ingredienser/havrefiber/3.-promoat/banner-promoat-health-benefits.jpg?maxwidth=768">
        </picture>
        <div class="banner-wrap">
            <div class="banner-body">

                    <div class="banner-body-inner">
                                <h2 class="banner-title">Health benefits </h2>
                        <div class="banner-text">
<p>PromOat Oat beta-glucan &ndash; The natural, healthy, functional oat ingredient. PromOat, a unique soluble fibre ingredient from oats, gives your products access to the positive effects associated with oats, including promotion of healthy cholesterol levels, a low glycaemic response and healthy digestion. It is also a good source of additional fibre to a variety of food and drink products.&nbsp;</p>
                                <a class="banner-link" href="/food-ingredients/products/oat-beta-glucan/promoat/health-benefits/"><span class="banner-link-label">Read more</span></a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
            </div>
        </div>
</div>
</div><div>
<!-- List / -->
<div id="5640745" class="list list--flex list--flex--white  ">

        <h2 class="list-title">PromOat&#x27;s Health Benefits</h2>




    <div id="list-data" class="list-wrapper list-threecolumn js-ajax-list-replace" data-cols="sm:1,md:2,lg:2,xl:3,xxl:3">



<div class="list-inner-wrapper--static-area"><div><!-- Callout / -->


<div id="5640750" class="callout callout--infographic">
            <div class="callout-wrap">
                    <picture class="callout-picture">
                        <!--[if IE 9]><video style="display: none;"><![endif]-->
                        <source srcset="/contentassets/40e9a5c2f73547828b6936386d7ba8fe/blood_suger_balance_text.svg?maxwidth=370" media="(min-width: 768px)">
                        <!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]-->
                        <img srcset="/contentassets/40e9a5c2f73547828b6936386d7ba8fe/blood_suger_balance_text.svg?maxwidth=500" class="callout-image">
                    </picture>
                <div class="callout-body">
                    <div class="callout-text"> 

<p style="margin-bottom: 10px; text-align: center;"><strong>Healthy blood glucose levels</strong></p>
<p style="text-align: center;">PromOat can be used on its own or in food and beverages, in order to help maintain healthy blood glucose levels. Research shows that consumption of beta-glucans from oats, as part of a meal, contributes to the reduction of blood glucose spikes after that meal.</p></div>
                </div>
            </div>
</div>
<!-- / Callout -->
</div><div><!-- Callout / -->


<div id="5640746" class="callout callout--infographic">
            <div class="callout-wrap">
                    <picture class="callout-picture">
                        <!--[if IE 9]><video style="display: none;"><![endif]-->
                        <source srcset="/siteassets/5.-food-ingredients/ingredienser/havrefiber/3.-promoat/heart-balance.svg?maxwidth=370" media="(min-width: 768px)">
                        <!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]-->
                        <img srcset="/siteassets/5.-food-ingredients/ingredienser/havrefiber/3.-promoat/heart-balance.svg?maxwidth=500" class="callout-image">
                    </picture>
                <div class="callout-body">
                    <div class="callout-text"> 

<p style="margin-bottom: 10px;"><strong>Healthy cholesterol levels</strong></p>
<p>PromOat can be used for its beneficial effect on heart health. In Europe, the following health claim for oat beta-glucan is approved: Oat beta-glucan has been shown to lower/reduce blood cholesterol. High cholesterol is a risk factor in the development of coronary heart disease.</p></div>
                </div>
            </div>
</div>
<!-- / Callout -->
</div><div><!-- Callout / -->


<div id="5640751" class="callout callout--infographic">
            <div class="callout-wrap">
                    <picture class="callout-picture">
                        <!--[if IE 9]><video style="display: none;"><![endif]-->
                        <source srcset="/siteassets/5.-food-ingredients/ingredienser/havrefiber/3.-promoat/gut-balance.svg?maxwidth=370" media="(min-width: 768px)">
                        <!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]-->
                        <img srcset="/siteassets/5.-food-ingredients/ingredienser/havrefiber/3.-promoat/gut-balance.svg?maxwidth=500" class="callout-image">
                    </picture>
                <div class="callout-body">
                    <div class="callout-text"> 

<p style="margin-bottom: 10px; text-align: center;"><strong>Healthy digestion <br /></strong></p>
<p style="text-align: center;">PromOat can be used in food and beverages for its beneficial effects on digestive and intestinal health. In addition, it provides soluble fibres, which may help promote satiety and facilitate weight management.</p></div>
                </div>
            </div>
</div>
<!-- / Callout -->
</div></div>    </div>



</div>


<!-- / List --></div><div>

<!-- Content / -->
<div id="5640758" class="content content-centered">
            <h2 class="content-title">Applications</h2>
    <div class="content-body">
        


    </div>
</div>
<!-- / Content -->
</div><div>
<!-- List / -->
<div id="5640754" class="list list--pingpong list--pingpong-reverse  ">





    <div id="list-data" class="list-wrapper list-onecolumn js-ajax-list-replace" data-cols="sm:1,md:1,lg:1,xl:1,xxl:1">



<div class="list-inner-wrapper--static-area"><div><!-- Callout / -->


<div id="5640755" class="callout callout-standard">
        <div class="callout-wrap">

                <picture class="callout-picture">
                    <!--[if IE 9]><video style="display: none;"><![endif]-->
                    <source srcset="/siteassets/5.-food-ingredients/ingredienser/havrefiber/3.-promoat/teaser-applications-list.jpg?maxwidth=370" media="(min-width: 768px)">
                    <!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]-->
                    <img srcset="/siteassets/5.-food-ingredients/ingredienser/havrefiber/3.-promoat/teaser-applications-list.jpg?maxwidth=500" class="callout-image">
                </picture>

            <div class="callout-body">
                <h3 class="callout-title"></h3>
                <div class="callout-text"> 

<p>PromOat Oat beta-glucan is soluble and has strong water-binding and emulsifying properties, creating a smooth texture and creamy mouthfeel in a variety of products. A natural component of whole grain Nordic oats, it can be applied in &lsquo;clean label&rsquo; products for its texturing or nutritional properties. It can be applied in a variety of formulations and combined with other health ingredients.</p></div>
            </div>

        </div>
</div>
<!-- / Callout -->
</div></div>    </div>


        <div class="list-link">
            <a href="/food-ingredients/products/oat-beta-glucan/promoat/applications/">Read more about PromOat Applications</a>
        </div>

</div>


<!-- / List --></div><div>

<!-- Content / -->
<div id="5640762" class="content content-centered">
            <h2 class="content-title">Functional benefits</h2>
    <div class="content-body">
        


    </div>
</div>
<!-- / Content -->
</div><div>
<!-- List / -->
<div id="5640761" class="list list--pingpong  ">





    <div id="list-data" class="list-wrapper list-onecolumn js-ajax-list-replace" data-cols="sm:1,md:1,lg:1,xl:1,xxl:1">



<div class="list-inner-wrapper--static-area"><div><!-- Callout / -->


<div id="5640756" class="callout callout-standard">
        <div class="callout-wrap">

                <picture class="callout-picture">
                    <!--[if IE 9]><video style="display: none;"><![endif]-->
                    <source srcset="/siteassets/5.-food-ingredients/ingredienser/havrefiber/3.-promoat/teaser-functional-benefits.jpg?maxwidth=370" media="(min-width: 768px)">
                    <!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]-->
                    <img srcset="/siteassets/5.-food-ingredients/ingredienser/havrefiber/3.-promoat/teaser-functional-benefits.jpg?maxwidth=500" class="callout-image">
                </picture>

            <div class="callout-body">
                <h3 class="callout-title"></h3>
                <div class="callout-text"> 

<p><strong>Clean taste, neutral colour, no graininess</strong>&nbsp;&ndash; PromOat is produced as a creamy white, neutral tasting powder that integrates easily into recipes of various kinds.</p>
<p><strong>Soluble and clean </strong>&ndash;&nbsp;Ideal in, for example, beverages where it can also contribute to a perfect mouthfeel and smoothness.</p>
<p><strong>Stabiliser and viscosity modifier</strong>&nbsp;&ndash; Strong water-binding and emulsifying properties. It thickens and stabilises creamy emulsions, creating a smooth texture and&nbsp;an indulgent creamy mouthfeel. PromOat can be used as the only ingredient for this purpose or in combinations with hydrocolloids, gums and starches from ex. potato, wheat etc and other emulsifiers as well as stabilizers.</p>
<p><strong>Improved shelf-life</strong> &ndash; Baked products such as reduced fat muffins or cakes can get improved shelf-life due to improved moisture management through the use of PromOat.</p>
<p><strong>Easy to use and easy to handle</strong> &ndash; It Integrates easily in manufacturing conditions and is acid and heat stable.</p>
<p><strong>Fat substitute</strong>&nbsp;&ndash; Helps to re-balance recipes fat and calorie content due to fat-mimicking properties.</p>
<p><strong>Increase beta-glucans </strong>&ndash; Can be used in other drinks,&nbsp;such as oat drinks in order to increase the level of beta-glucans.</p>
<p><strong>Prebiotic benefits</strong> &ndash; PromOat can also be used as a prebiotic fiber.</p></div>
            </div>

        </div>
</div>
<!-- / Callout -->
</div></div>    </div>



</div>


