                                <h2 class="banner-title">Lantmännen takes responsibility from field to fork</h2>
                        <div class="banner-text">
<p><span class="TextRun SCXW254044887 BCX0" lang="EN-GB" xml:lang="EN-GB" data-contrast="none"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW254044887 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="xmsonormal" data-ccp-parastyle-defn="{&quot;ObjectId&quot;:&quot;2fd2fc41-082a-4849-89c5-9e4fd903f452|6&quot;,&quot;ClassId&quot;:1073872969,&quot;Properties&quot;:[469775450,&quot;xmsonormal&quot;,201340122,&quot;2&quot;,134233614,&quot;true&quot;,469778129,&quot;xmsonormal&quot;,335572020,&quot;1&quot;,469777841,&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,469777842,&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,469777844,&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,469769226,&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,268442635,&quot;24&quot;,335559705,&quot;1053&quot;,335559740,&quot;240&quot;,201341983,&quot;0&quot;,335559739,&quot;0&quot;,469778324,&quot;Normal&quot;]}">Lantm&auml;nnen is an agricultural cooperative and Northern Europe&rsquo;s leader in agriculture, machinery,&nbsp;</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW254044887 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="xmsonormal">bioenergy</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW254044887 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="xmsonormal"> and food products. Owned by </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW254044887 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="xmsonormal">1</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW254044887 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="xmsonormal">8</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW254044887 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="xmsonormal">,000 Swedish farmers, we have 1</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW254044887 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="xmsonormal">2</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW254044887 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="xmsonormal">,000 employees and an annual turnover of </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW254044887 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="xmsonormal">approximately </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW254044887 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="xmsonormal">SEK </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW254044887 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="xmsonormal">70</span> <span class="NormalTextRun SCXW254044887 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="xmsonormal">billion. With research and operations throughout the value chain, we take responsibility from field to fork.</span></span></p>
                                <a class="banner-link" href="https://www.lantmannen.fi/en/"><span class="banner-link-label">Read more about Lantm&#xE4;nnen</span></a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
            </div>
        </div>
</div>
